        "id": "disposable-heat-pack",
        "word": "disposable heat pack",
        "chinese": "暖暖包",
        "chineseDefinition": "用來為手部或身體保暖的一次性小包，常見款接觸空氣後會發熱。",
        "category": "drugstore",
        "partOfSpeech": "noun",
        "pronunciation": "/dɪˈspoʊ.zə.bəl hiːt pæk/",
        "cefrLevel": "A2",
        "ja": "使い捨てカイロ",
        "jaReading": "つかいすてカイロ",
        "jaReadingSegments": [
          {
            "text": "使い捨て",
            "ruby": "つかいすて"
          },
          {
            "text": "カイロ",
            "ruby": null
          }
        ],
        "definitions": [
          {
            "language": "zh",
            "definition": "暖暖包",
            "sortOrder": 0
          },
          {
            "language": "en",
            "definition": "A small, single-use pack that provides warmth for the hands or body. Common types give off heat when exposed to air.",
            "sortOrder": 0
          },
          {
            "language": "ja",
            "definition": "手や体を温めるための使い切りの小さなカイロ。空気に触れると発熱するタイプがよく見られる。",
            "sortOrder": 0
          }
        ],
        "note": "暖暖包有黏貼式和非黏貼式，圖中是非黏貼式。",
        "localizedNotes": {
          "en": "Disposable heat packs come in stick-on and non-adhesive types. The illustration shows a non-adhesive pack.",
          "ja": "貼るタイプと貼らないタイプがある。図は貼らないタイプ。"
        },
        "relatedWords": [],
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I bought a disposable heat pack at the drugstore.",
            "ja": "ドラッグストアで使い捨てカイロを買いました。",
            "zh": "我在藥妝店買了一個暖暖包。",
            "cefrLevel": "A2"
          },
          {
            "en": "I put a disposable heat pack in my bag before leaving because it was cold outside.",
            "ja": "外が寒かったので、出かける前に使い捨てカイロをかばんに入れました。",
            "zh": "因為外面很冷，我出門前把暖暖包放進包包裡。",
            "cefrLevel": "B1"
          }
        ],
